1
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:09,540
What's with you?

2
00:00:09,760 --> 00:00:11,397
Would you stop this nonsense already?

3
00:00:11,480 --> 00:00:14,877
Usopp just got worked up because
things were moving too fast, right?

4
00:00:14,960 --> 00:00:18,437
That's no reason to fight with your
own friend, especially when he's hurt.

5
00:00:18,520 --> 00:00:22,873
If you give it some time, I'm sure
both of you will see how silly this is.

6
00:00:23,280 --> 00:00:25,480
You've gone too far to turn back now.

7
00:00:25,980 --> 00:00:27,040
That's not true.

8
00:00:27,280 --> 00:00:31,927
There's nothing stopping you from
apologizing and talking it over one more time

9
00:00:32,780 --> 00:00:38,160
Like I said no turning back and why not?

10
00:00:39,040 --> 00:00:41,677
Usopp is willing to risk
his life to fight me.

11
00:00:41,760 --> 00:00:43,320
He's more than just angry

12
00:00:43,820 --> 00:00:47,257
Besides if just talking it over
was enough to make things right.

13
00:00:47,340 --> 00:00:50,164
We wouldn't have come to
this in the first place

14
00:00:50,460 --> 00:00:52,695
That's all I have to say so good night

15
00:00:55,900 --> 00:00:59,397
luffy think about it you said
the Franky family came here

16
00:00:59,480 --> 00:01:03,477
this afternoon right yeah so
what are you trying to say if

17
00:01:03,560 --> 00:01:05,817
you hadn't let them off so easy
they wouldn't have stolen the

18
00:01:05,900 --> 00:01:08,557
money from us in the first
place it's your fault those guys

19
00:01:08,640 --> 00:01:11,417
attacked Usopp he's just freaking
out because he feels guilty

20
00:01:11,500 --> 00:01:14,517
hey don't go blaming me for
not kicking their asses hard

21
00:01:14,600 --> 00:01:17,217
enough you were the one who
ran off to go shopping what am

22
00:01:17,300 --> 00:01:20,829
i supposed to cook if i don't
have any food both of you shut

23
00:01:21,680 --> 00:01:23,856
There's been enough fighting already.

24
00:01:25,900 --> 00:01:28,640
Whatever happened, it's
over now. Oh, I know.

25
00:01:28,920 --> 00:01:31,979
But this wouldn't be happening
if it wasn't for him.

26
00:01:34,860 --> 00:01:36,700
Oh, hey. You're back.

27
00:01:37,100 --> 00:01:39,453
You were going after Usopp, weren't you?

28
00:01:41,880 --> 00:01:44,817
Even if he was mad, I still
wanted to treat his wounds.

29
00:01:44,900 --> 00:01:46,340
But he turned me away.

30
00:01:47,260 --> 00:01:50,920
He found a place to stay, so
at least he can get some rest.

31
00:01:51,320 --> 00:01:53,379
But do you know what he said to me?

32
00:01:53,740 --> 00:01:59,720
He said we aren't friends now, so I should
leave him alone and go back to the ship.

33
00:02:04,120 --> 00:02:07,540
Just this morning, we were
all so happy, and now what?

34
00:02:11,300 --> 00:02:12,740
We lost Usopp.

35
00:02:13,560 --> 00:02:14,517
Robin's still missing.

36
00:02:14,600 --> 00:02:20,800
I feel like if we don't do something,
the whole crew is going to fall apart.

37
00:02:26,980 --> 00:02:28,240
It's ten o 'clock.

38
00:02:28,840 --> 00:02:30,840
Lusop will be here any second now.

39
00:02:40,460 --> 00:02:41,340
Listen up!

40
00:02:41,520 --> 00:02:43,377
I don't want any of you leaving the ship!

41
00:02:43,460 --> 00:02:44,700
You got that?

42
00:02:51,400 --> 00:02:52,260
Look!

43
00:02:52,480 --> 00:02:53,900
Please don't fight!

44
00:03:17,100 --> 00:03:19,357
so you didn't lose your nerve after all?

45
00:03:19,440 --> 00:03:22,437
no matter how this battle
ends, you can't regret it.

46
00:03:22,520 --> 00:03:24,757
this is exactly what you asked for!

47
00:03:24,840 --> 00:03:26,297
that's perfect.

48
00:03:26,380 --> 00:03:28,037
don't go easy on me.

49
00:03:28,120 --> 00:03:30,337
i won't be the underdog this time.

50
00:03:30,420 --> 00:03:34,157
in fact, i've already figured
out a way to defeat you.

51
00:03:34,240 --> 00:03:36,037
shouldn't we stop this?

52
00:03:36,120 --> 00:03:38,180
usap's injuries They're pretty bad.

53
00:03:38,460 --> 00:03:40,997
If you can't stand to
watch, then go inside.

54
00:03:41,080 --> 00:03:42,060
Make no mistake.

55
00:03:42,440 --> 00:03:45,146
I'm not like any opponent
you've faced before.

56
00:03:45,660 --> 00:03:47,484
We've been friends a long time.

57
00:03:47,720 --> 00:03:51,896
I know all your powers, all your
strengths, and all of your weaknesses.

58
00:05:19,700 --> 00:05:25,460
If you wake up in a dream, it will
be a place to go to the future.

59
00:05:26,100 --> 00:05:28,860
So let's take a look at the same path.

60
00:05:29,480 --> 00:05:35,940
We are one of them.

61
00:05:48,320 --> 00:05:50,700
I have 8,000 men on my side!

62
00:05:50,920 --> 00:05:54,096
If you don't surrender now,
I'll order them to attack!

63
00:05:55,080 --> 00:05:55,910
What?

64
00:05:56,120 --> 00:05:57,760
Why didn't he tell me?

65
00:05:57,920 --> 00:05:59,449
Seriously, just go inside.

66
00:05:59,600 --> 00:06:02,677
If you're gonna fight, then
at least take this seriously!

67
00:06:02,760 --> 00:06:04,520
Ooh, Speed!

68
00:06:04,800 --> 00:06:09,480
You have razor-sharp needles stuck
between all of your teeth! Ah!

69
00:06:09,780 --> 00:06:11,817
It hurts just to imagine that!

70
00:06:11,900 --> 00:06:13,488
I'm telling you, go inside.

71
00:06:13,800 --> 00:06:16,800
You've got prickly cactus
spines under your finger!

72
00:06:18,180 --> 00:06:19,300
Gum-Gum!

73
00:06:19,820 --> 00:06:20,720
Pistol!

74
00:06:26,560 --> 00:06:27,940
What happened?

75
00:06:29,540 --> 00:06:30,560
Who's that?

76
00:06:30,920 --> 00:06:31,920
Please don't die!

77
00:06:33,300 --> 00:06:36,140
Special attack, Ketchup Star.

78
00:06:37,080 --> 00:06:38,800
Pity for your enemy.

79
00:06:39,060 --> 00:06:41,297
That's awfully arrogant, don't you think?

80
00:06:41,380 --> 00:06:42,580
Flash dial!

81
00:06:48,660 --> 00:06:50,540
Now, special attack, Eggstar!

82
00:06:52,940 --> 00:06:54,640
Again, again, again!

83
00:06:57,500 --> 00:06:59,560
Oh, it stinks! They're rotten!

84
00:07:00,020 --> 00:07:02,726
Dammit, would you stop
messing around already?

85
00:07:02,860 --> 00:07:04,497
You think this is a joke, huh?

86
00:07:04,580 --> 00:07:06,051
Because I'm dead serious.

87
00:07:06,380 --> 00:07:07,800
Oh, yeah? That's right.

88
00:07:08,020 --> 00:07:09,417
This is the way I fight.

89
00:07:09,500 --> 00:07:12,735
Careful, that gaping mouth
of yours is gonna get burnt!

90
00:07:17,020 --> 00:07:19,040
Special attack, Tabasco Star!

91
00:07:19,960 --> 00:07:20,790
What?

92
00:07:21,940 --> 00:07:24,217
I wouldn't jump around
too much if I were you,

93
00:07:24,300 --> 00:07:27,006
because the whole
battlefield is Keltrop Hell!

94
00:07:31,980 --> 00:07:33,620
He's controlling the fight.

95
00:07:34,680 --> 00:07:35,540
Listen, Luffy,

96
00:07:35,900 --> 00:07:39,597
you can pity me if you want, but I'm
gonna beat you and take the Mary with me!

97
00:07:39,680 --> 00:07:41,940
And I don't care what it takes!

98
00:07:43,040 --> 00:07:45,000
Special attack, Pimpersaur!

99
00:07:55,760 --> 00:08:00,054
Like I said, I know you, so I know
which attacks are gonna work the best!

100
00:08:03,760 --> 00:08:04,600
Damn it!

101
00:08:05,040 --> 00:08:06,340
This stuff stinks!

102
00:08:06,660 --> 00:08:08,260
My mouth is burning!

103
00:08:09,680 --> 00:08:10,510
And it hurts!

104
00:08:10,593 --> 00:08:12,417
I'm not gonna give you
an itch, you hear me?

105
00:08:12,500 --> 00:08:15,020
Special attack, Shiniken Shooting Star!

106
00:09:02,220 --> 00:09:04,260
I'm using a breath dial.

107
00:09:06,140 --> 00:09:09,375
You didn't notice the smell
because of the rotten eggs.

108
00:09:13,000 --> 00:09:16,260
And now you're completely
surrounded by gas!

109
00:09:17,340 --> 00:09:18,300
Gas?

110
00:09:18,500 --> 00:09:19,817
Don't tell me he...

111
00:09:19,900 --> 00:09:20,740
Sorry!

112
00:09:22,700 --> 00:09:23,660
Flamescar!

113
00:09:36,300 --> 00:09:38,160
That one's gonna sting!

114
00:09:57,640 --> 00:10:02,464
I am Usopp, leader of the invincible nation
of pirates who reign over this island.

115
00:10:04,000 --> 00:10:07,777
You stand before a living legend, the
most revered pirate who ever lived.

116
00:10:07,860 --> 00:10:09,820
I am the great Captain Usopp!

117
00:10:18,960 --> 00:10:20,360
That's pretty cool!

118
00:10:20,780 --> 00:10:23,940
Shut your mouth or I'll
shut it for you! How come?

119
00:10:24,480 --> 00:10:26,600
We're friends, right? So get on!

120
00:10:31,220 --> 00:10:32,050
Hey!

121
00:10:32,133 --> 00:10:32,963
I see an island!

122
00:10:34,040 --> 00:10:34,870
Awesome!

123
00:10:35,040 --> 00:10:36,617
I can't wait to check it out!

124
00:10:36,700 --> 00:10:38,777
All right, let's go.

125
00:10:38,860 --> 00:10:40,997
Mary, full speed ahead.

126
00:10:41,080 --> 00:10:44,320
Full speed ahead.

127
00:11:14,780 --> 00:11:17,700
I can't take this anymore. Luffy!

128
00:11:18,400 --> 00:11:19,440
Luce up!

129
00:11:37,020 --> 00:11:38,200
I'm no fool.

130
00:11:38,580 --> 00:11:41,397
I realize it'll take more
than that to beat you.

131
00:11:41,480 --> 00:11:42,880
I know you, Luffy.

132
00:11:43,420 --> 00:11:46,240
You fight every battle
with all your strength.

133
00:11:48,940 --> 00:11:51,500
But I'm ready for any
technique you've got.

134
00:11:56,460 --> 00:11:57,480
Special attack!

135
00:11:57,680 --> 00:11:58,540
Come, come!

136
00:12:02,120 --> 00:12:02,950
Blasting...

137
00:12:03,033 --> 00:12:04,020
Captain Stars!

138
00:12:06,700 --> 00:12:07,530
Ah!

139
00:12:14,560 --> 00:12:15,860
Triple exploding star!

140
00:12:30,880 --> 00:12:31,880
Now Gawgawm!

141
00:12:32,760 --> 00:12:33,860
It's Kaku!

142
00:12:45,580 --> 00:12:47,900
It's time to put an end to this!

143
00:12:49,080 --> 00:12:49,910
Gonzo!

144
00:12:50,720 --> 00:12:51,550
Bazooka!

145
00:12:55,300 --> 00:12:56,130
Hmm.

146
00:12:57,220 --> 00:12:58,340
Recognize this?

147
00:12:58,560 --> 00:13:00,619
I bet that bazooka would have hurt.

148
00:13:00,820 --> 00:13:02,160
Let's find out!

149
00:13:03,440 --> 00:13:04,270
Impact!

150
00:13:10,320 --> 00:13:12,420
He used an impact dial!

151
00:13:19,680 --> 00:13:22,120
I won't lose to you!

152
00:13:51,720 --> 00:13:56,544
I am Usopp, leader of the Invincible Nation
of Pirates who reign over this island!

153
00:14:03,240 --> 00:14:05,960
Cheers to a new ship and a new Gourmet!

154
00:14:10,160 --> 00:14:11,980
So, how do you like this one?

155
00:14:12,200 --> 00:14:14,080
Yeah, keep it. That's the one.

156
00:14:14,420 --> 00:14:16,560
Okay, it's all done.

157
00:14:16,840 --> 00:14:20,320
Now the Going Mary has everything
she could possibly need.

158
00:14:22,160 --> 00:14:23,320
Com Com!

159
00:14:37,460 --> 00:14:38,860
Usopp!

160
00:15:07,120 --> 00:15:08,760
At least it's over now.

161
00:15:23,680 --> 00:15:24,760
You idiot!

162
00:15:27,160 --> 00:15:29,200
You knew it would end like this!

163
00:15:29,540 --> 00:15:31,840
You knew you could never beat me!

164
00:15:58,740 --> 00:16:01,060
Why did this have to happen?

165
00:16:10,620 --> 00:16:12,796
Do whatever you want with them, Mary.

166
00:16:16,900 --> 00:16:19,260
I won't let anything hold us back.

167
00:16:19,560 --> 00:16:22,800
We're getting a new ship
and sailing forward.

168
00:16:24,220 --> 00:16:25,960
Hey, let me sit up there!

169
00:16:26,280 --> 00:16:29,177
Sorry, Usopp, but this seat's
reserved for the captain.

170
00:16:29,260 --> 00:16:30,672
Oh, what are you making?

171
00:16:30,880 --> 00:16:32,520
Let me see, let me see!

172
00:16:32,880 --> 00:16:36,998
Hold on, the Usopp factory is
off-limits until I finish this for Nami.

173
00:16:46,720 --> 00:16:48,200
Guys, listen up.

174
00:16:48,500 --> 00:16:50,620
I will go to Elbas someday.

175
00:16:51,000 --> 00:16:52,920
To the Village of Warriors!

176
00:16:53,460 --> 00:16:54,720
Yeah, great!

177
00:16:56,820 --> 00:17:00,160
It's the festival on the
night before gold hunting!

178
00:17:12,340 --> 00:17:13,780
So long, Usopp.

179
00:17:14,660 --> 00:17:15,840
It was fun!

180
00:17:16,600 --> 00:17:17,720
While it lasted.

181
00:17:22,860 --> 00:17:24,331
Chopper, leave him alone.

182
00:17:25,920 --> 00:17:27,160
What are you saying?

183
00:17:27,340 --> 00:17:32,222
He was already hurt before the fight If I
don't help him, who knows what'll happen?

184
00:17:32,640 --> 00:17:35,380
He isn't part of our
crew anymore. So what?

185
00:17:35,540 --> 00:17:36,400
I'm a doctor!

186
00:17:36,700 --> 00:17:38,020
It's my doctor dream!

187
00:17:43,660 --> 00:17:45,677
It's bad enough that he lost the duel.

188
00:17:45,760 --> 00:17:47,357
If you pity him at a time like this,

189
00:17:47,440 --> 00:17:50,852
you'll end up hurting him more
than any of those injuries.

190
00:17:52,200 --> 00:17:53,897
I'm sure you have good intentions,

191
00:17:53,980 --> 00:17:57,098
but all we can do now is
give him dignity and defeat.

192
00:17:57,760 --> 00:18:02,620
He knew that when he challenged Luffy
to a duel, this is how it might end.

193
00:18:14,880 --> 00:18:16,060
It's too much.

194
00:18:17,880 --> 00:18:19,998
This is what it means to be captain.

195
00:18:21,280 --> 00:18:22,880
You can't doubt yourself.

196
00:18:24,840 --> 00:18:28,040
In times like these, if
you lose your confidence

197
00:18:29,080 --> 00:18:30,940
Then who can we have faith in?

198
00:18:42,700 --> 00:18:44,560
Let's pack our things and go.

199
00:18:55,400 --> 00:18:56,860
You know as well as me.

200
00:18:57,680 --> 00:18:58,697
That after tonight.

201
00:18:58,780 --> 00:19:01,220
We can never return to this ship again?

202
00:19:32,320 --> 00:19:33,637
Thank

203
00:19:33,720 --> 00:19:35,037
you

204
00:19:35,120 --> 00:19:40,677
so

205
00:19:40,760 --> 00:19:42,500
much for watching.

206
00:20:14,060 --> 00:20:15,377
Thank

207
00:20:15,460 --> 00:20:16,777
you

208
00:20:16,860 --> 00:20:22,797
so much for watching.
